{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_01",
      "hash": "cab3e0ff3ae74cc6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿桔：……哈！哈！哈！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_06",
      "hash": "cab3e3ff3ae751df",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "像你这样的小孩子，\\n居然想对在下发起挑战……\\r\\n简直是可笑至极！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_07",
      "hash": "cab3e2ff3ae7502c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……令对手无从抵抗，\\n在剧毒中自然灭亡……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_08",
      "hash": "cab3e9ff3ae75c11",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……就让你见识一下\\n忍术的极致之处吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_gym06_01_02",
      "hash": "7f14c616ef4033a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 4]"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_02",
      "hash": "cab3dfff3ae74b13",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喂！\\n请你收下这粉红徽章吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8050_sys_01",
      "hash": "524a709f73eb2021",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从阿桔那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]粉红徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_03",
      "hash": "cab3deff3ae74960",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了粉红徽章，\\n无论是从谁那里得到的宝可梦，\\r\\n等级[VAR NUM2(0004)]为止的宝可梦都会听命于你！\\c\\n对了……！这个就给你了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8050_sys_02",
      "hash": "524a6d9f73eb1b08",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从阿桔那里\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n“[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_04",
      "hash": "cab3e5ff3ae75545",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这是在下的家族里\\n代代相传了400年的宝可梦招式。\\c\\n在这招式学习器27里，\\n封印着绝招“剧毒”！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8050_poison_05",
      "hash": "cab3e4ff3ae75392",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "“剧毒”可以使对手在中毒后\\n每回合受到更大的中毒伤害！\\c\\n这是个能让对手\\n感受到恐怖的招式。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8050_max",
